{"id": "idaho-1", "headline": "San Diego State upsets No. 15 Boise State 22-20", "source": "KIVI / AP", "url": "https://www.kivitv.com/sports/boise-state/san-diego-state-shocks-no-15-boise-state-22-20-with-game-winning-field-goal", "published": "2026-11-22", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Cooper DiLeva kicked a 42-yard field goal as time expired, and San Diego State scored nine points in the last two minutes to beat No. 15 Boise State 22-20 on Saturday night in Boise. The Broncos, now 9-2, squandered a 20-13 lead and took a hit to their playoff hopes. A 37-yard touchdown catch by Jaylon Hawkins cut the gap to 20-19 with 1:51 left. Boise State recovered an onside kick, but on fourth-and-3 coach Spencer Danielson went for it and quarterback Maddux Madsen was stopped for a 1-yard loss, ending a run of 13 straight fourth-down conversions. Danielson said the call was on him. San Diego State clinched a spot in the Pac-12 title game and will return to Boise for a rematch on Dec. 4.", "Source: KIVI / AP."], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110001000101011110100101111001111111", "10000010100010011010101010010000001000001", "10111010001100111000011000111001101011101", "10111010100100000101000011110110001011101", "10111010011100111011110100001101001011101", "10000010111111000000110011011100001000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000011010101001111100101011000000000", "11111011111011100101001101011100110101010", "11001000111111000111101101001011101111011", "01101110011001111000011000110110010100010", "10000100000101011010111110100010101111000", "10000110000000111010001011110110100101100", "00011101111011010011110101001001001111101", "00100110101000011100111001111110000111000", "11101101011010010001110010111001001101010", "00111110110011110100001101101100110100100", "01001000100100001011110100001011111110001", "10001010100010010010101000111010100100010", "10001100010100111010110000101010010111000", "01100111100110010011001111000111100001110", "001110011110